</description><pubDate>Sat, 27 Jun 2026 13:27:04 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>罗天成</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/p/533-tiancheng-luo</link><description>&lt;p&gt;罗天成（又名bbbigdear）是一位产品设计师兼科技与生活方式创作者，专注于工作空间美学、现代生活方式和精心设计的科技产品。他通过电影般的叙事方式和亲身体验的产品探索，分享融合功能性与视觉设计的工具和物件。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Instagram → &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/bbbigdeer/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;instagram.com/bbbigdeer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Threads → &lt;a href="https://www.threads.com/@bbbigdeer?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;threads.com/@bbbigdeer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;TikTok → &lt;a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@bbbigdeer?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;tiktok.com/@bbbigdeer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;YouTube → &lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/@bigdeeer?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;youtube.com/@bigdeeer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/6c438768-b421-4d9b-87d8-065b787f5105/DSC00691.jpg?t=1781356253"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/d26029e6-c1a3-4cd5-8f65-f84e086d7bc6/DSC00650.jpg?t=1781356353"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/1b47e11a-2c6a-4f09-aa37-1de07bdb25bb/DSC00709.jpg?t=1781356371"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/f083ab73-6412-4ead-a530-716902177120/DSC00642.jpg?t=1781356383"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/2ce43d6a-bdbb-49ef-8d63-a4fd0ebe7a26/DSC00721.jpg?t=1781356406"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/fa4bc797-bcf0-4f10-a8ba-25aded6d6fe2/DSC00786.jpg?t=1781356421"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/433084ce-c5c0-427f-a4c0-47ff009ea4e9/DSC00747.jpg?t=1781356434"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/a9cf57db-ccf6-40a5-930d-db8c98101a7b/DSC00761.jpg?t=1781356447"/&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你的工作空间里有哪些主要物品？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://workspacesxyz.link/LShaped?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Vernal L型站立式办公桌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.apple.com/studio-display/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Apple Studio Display&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Apple Mac Mini&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/3QeShkY?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Lofree触控鼠标&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/3QmgoOC?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Harman Kardon Aura Studio音箱&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/4aqVbtC?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Bambu Lab A1 3D打印机&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;分体式人体工学机械键盘&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你最近添加到工作空间的物品是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我工作空间最近新增的物品是&lt;a href="https://workspacesxyz.link/LShaped?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;来自Vernal的L型站立式办公桌&lt;/a&gt;。它彻底改变了我工作区域的氛围，让我有更多空间来区分不同类型的工作，同时让整个环境感觉更有条理。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你希望对当前工作空间做哪一项改变？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我希望我的工作空间能更宁静、更有设计意图。不仅仅是桌面表面，而是更立体的层面。目前我觉得墙面空间还需要更精心的设计，让整个环境更协调、更有条理。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;请介绍一下你的晨间惯例——你到办公桌前做的第一件事是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;打开音箱。这总是我做的第一件事。音乐能帮助我自然地进入工作状态。之后，我通常会查看消息，整理当天的思路，然后慢慢进入拍摄或写脚本的状态。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;哪一条效率技巧对你真正有效？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我认为每个人都应该最终建立起自己独特的工作流程，而不是试图模仿别人的。目前，AI大概占我工作室工作流程的30%左右，所以学会如何与AI工具协作对我来说变得非常重要。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你每天使用的最被低估的应用程序或工具是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;ChatGPT。我认为每个人的ChatGPT都会随着时间推移变得不同。经过数月的对话后，它会开始更深入地理解你。对我来说，它不再只是一个工具，而是帮助我整理思路、完善概念、挑战思维的东西。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.beehiiv.com/powered-by?publication_logo=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.beehiiv.com%2Fcdn-cgi%2Fimage%2Ffit%3Dscale-down%2Cformat%3Dauto%2Conerror%3Dredirect%2Cquality%3D80%2Fuploads%2Fpublication%2Flogo%2F9e0ab799-69a2-448f-b9a1-c03f8f3356e9%2FLogo_2.png%3Fv%3D1787455345&amp;amp;publication_name=Workspaces&amp;amp;utm_campaign=ab3ba0e7-f734-4297-959d-c056ba0949b7&amp;amp;utm_medium=post_rss&amp;amp;utm_source=workspaces" target="_blank"&gt;Powered by beehiiv&lt;/a&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 13 Jun 2026 13:52:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Jack Zerby</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/p/240-jack-zerby</link><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,width=1200,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/83ffefc4-12e8-4eba-83aa-2833cea00251/Jack_Zerby_thumbnail.png?t=1781142493"/&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.jackzerby.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Jack Zerby&lt;/a&gt; 目前担任 &lt;a href="http://gumroad.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Gumroad&lt;/a&gt; 的设计主管，同时也是 &lt;a href="http://dogma.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Dogma&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="http://designfordecks.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Design For Decks&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="http://biddyhq.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Biddy&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="http://getdohq.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;DOHQ&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://Flavors.me?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Flavors.me&lt;/a&gt; 和 &lt;a href="https://www.businessinsider.com/what-is-goodsie-2011-5?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Goodsie&lt;/a&gt; 的创始人。&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;他曾为 &lt;a href="https://vimeo.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Vimeo&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://pentagram.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Pentagram&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://frogdesign.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Frog&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://rga.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;R/GA&lt;/a&gt; 等公司工作，并为 &lt;a href="https://teachable.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Teachable&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://americanexpress.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Amex&lt;/a&gt; 和 &lt;a href="https://staked.us/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Staked&lt;/a&gt; 等公司提供咨询服务。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Twitter → &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/jackzerby?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;twitter.com/jackzerby&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/82cc4dc3-638a-4519-812b-2f7d886e502a/image.png?t=1781142289"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/b0d3e3c1-2144-499a-9c87-dfa47ed0db9e/image.png?t=1781142303"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/f52ad4d3-6db1-43f2-8909-43f7de552298/image.png?t=1781142317"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/10e73223-99ca-43d5-bc5c-47dc9abef0f8/image.png?t=1781142331"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/bf263210-a906-497a-b49e-a224b5da2dc0/image.png?t=1781142346"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/57f0439f-b599-4d90-8837-1a2823061f7d/image.png?t=1781142360"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jack 的妻子最近重新设计了他的工作空间，才有了你今天看到的这个样子。&lt;a href="https://alovelyliving.com/office-update-featuring-ben-moore-caldwell-green/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby#/" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;你可以（而且应该！）在这里查看更多照片和设计背后的思考！&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你的工作空间里有哪些设备？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;绿色 iMac M1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;MAudio Keystation 61 键 MIDI 钢琴&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;用于播客录制的 EV RE20 麦克风&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pottery Barn Pittsburgh 站立式办公桌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://diycandy.com/diy-industrial-pipe-shelving/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;DIY 黑色管道置物架&lt;/a&gt;‍&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;琴叶榕&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.target.com/p/modern-floor-lamp-with-table-brass-threshold-8482/-/A-85606489?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;落地灯&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你最喜欢工作空间里的哪件物品？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我的办公桌绝对是我最喜欢的。它既有经典复古的感觉，又兼具现代站立式办公桌的优势。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你如何激发创造力？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;在 Spotify 上播放 Lo-Fi 节拍电台，手机调成静音。我喜欢 siteinspire.com 这类网站，但也会去 Barnes and Noble 买上一堆任何类别的精美杂志。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你如何管理工作与生活的平衡？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我通过 Notion 管理所有事务，为当周所有任务创建工单，并设定每季度的目标。无论发生什么，我都会在 5:30 停止工作，吃晚饭，和家人待在一起直到睡觉时间。周末不工作有助于我理清思绪，防止过度疲劳。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你认为远程工作的主要好处是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;没有干扰，无需通勤，并且能够围绕要完成的任务来安排我的一天，而不是以坐在办公桌前的时间长短来衡量。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.beehiiv.com/powered-by?publication_logo=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.beehiiv.com%2Fcdn-cgi%2Fimage%2Ffit%3Dscale-down%2Cformat%3Dauto%2Conerror%3Dredirect%2Cquality%3D80%2Fuploads%2Fpublication%2Flogo%2F9e0ab799-69a2-448f-b9a1-c03f8f3356e9%2FLogo_2.png%3Fv%3D1787455345&amp;amp;publication_name=Workspaces&amp;amp;utm_campaign=fd1ec894-f391-4e98-9262-7cdd00e472ba&amp;amp;utm_medium=post_rss&amp;amp;utm_source=workspaces" target="_blank"&gt;由 beehiiv 提供支持&lt;/a&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Jan 2023 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>杰克·雷恩斯</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/p/252-jack-raines</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Jack_Raines?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Jack Raines&lt;/a&gt; 是一个名为 &lt;a href="https://www.youngmoney.co/subscribe?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Young Money&lt;/a&gt; 的金融博客的作者，该博客每周有两万一千名读者阅读。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他同时还负责编辑 Litquidity 的每日金融通讯，&lt;a href="https://www.execsum.co/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Exec Sum&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;在做这些工作的同时，他还是哥伦比亚商学院的MBA候选人。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;有趣的事实：他曾被挪威驱逐出境，在阿根廷学会了萨尔萨舞，还差点因为一条&lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jackraines/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;讽刺性的LinkedIn帖子&lt;/a&gt;被商学院开除。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/2fbcbb73-0bf8-4377-a108-4ac404a2b846/image.png?t=1781141970"/&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你的工作空间里有哪些设备？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Macbook Pro&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.thexebec.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Xebec（附加的双显示器）&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;蓝牙鼠标&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;日记本（虽然不是工作空间的必需品，但总是放在我的包里）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你工作空间里最喜欢的物品是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我的Xebec。它便携，而且把我的屏幕面积扩大了三倍。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你是如何激发创造力的？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我从不主动激发创造力，而是它主动找上我。创造力通常在我去健身房、坐地铁或者凌晨一点在街边小酒吧的时候袭来。当灵感来临时，我会给自己发几条短信，等回到电脑前再回头查看。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你如何管理工作与生活的平衡？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;管理工作与生活平衡的最好方法，就是去做那些让你觉得不需要平衡的事情。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你典型的写作流程是怎样的？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我坐下来，写15分钟，然后上Twitter找一条我想引用的推文，在Twitter上拖延20分钟，把手机扔到床上，关掉Twitter，继续埋头写通讯。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.beehiiv.com/powered-by?publication_logo=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.beehiiv.com%2Fcdn-cgi%2Fimage%2Ffit%3Dscale-down%2Cformat%3Dauto%2Conerror%3Dredirect%2Cquality%3D80%2Fuploads%2Fpublication%2Flogo%2F9e0ab799-69a2-448f-b9a1-c03f8f3356e9%2FLogo_2.png%3Fv%3D1787455345&amp;amp;publication_name=Workspaces&amp;amp;utm_campaign=9f5948bf-7675-461c-a892-8a62fe13d825&amp;amp;utm_medium=post_rss&amp;amp;utm_source=workspaces" target="_blank"&gt;Powered by beehiiv&lt;/a&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 08 Feb 2023 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>大卫·海涅迈尔·汉森</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/p/253-david-heinemeier-hansson</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://dhh.dk?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;David Heinemeier Hansson&lt;/a&gt;（即DHH）不需要正式介绍。但我们还是打算介绍一下。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他是&lt;a href="https://rubyonrails.org/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Ruby on Rails&lt;/a&gt;的创造者，这个开源框架已被数十万开发者使用。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他是&lt;a href="https://basecamp.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Basecamp&lt;/a&gt;和&lt;a href="https://www.hey.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;HEY&lt;/a&gt;的联合创始人。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他是畅销书作家，与联合创始人Jason Fried合著了四本书（&lt;a href="https://37signals.com/books/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson#rework" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;REWORK&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://37signals.com/books/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson#calm" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;It Doesn't Have To Be Crazy At Work&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://37signals.com/books/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson#remote" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;REMOTE: Office Not Required&lt;/a&gt;和&lt;a href="https://37signals.com/books/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson#getting-real" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Getting Real&lt;/a&gt;）。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;如果这还不够的话，他还是FIA世界耐力锦标赛的&lt;a href="https://dhh.dk/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson#driver" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;赛车手&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Twitter → &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/dhh?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;twitter.com/dhh&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/269219fe-657a-455e-9fce-87aaafb183ec/image.png?t=1781141694"/&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你典型的一天是什么样的？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;清晨送孩子们上学。我通常在8:30左右坐下来工作。然后通常花一个小时左右处理邮件、报告之类的事情。最棒的日子从那时起就完全自由了，可以一头扎进有趣、有挑战性的项目里，最好是编程或写作。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你认为2023年远程工作的主要好处是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我已经远程工作二十年了，对我来说好处始终如一。可以自由选择居住地点，在家里的办公室工作，那里完全安静、利于专注，还能享受这种灵活性——白天就在家人隔壁。拿什么都不换。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你个人如何在多个进行中的项目之间平衡工作？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我尽量按季节来工作。有些季节专心编程，有些季节写作，还有些季节则专注于业务本身。多任务处理是一种幻象。人类能做的只有瞎忙活。所以一次只专注一个主要项目才是快速前进的关键。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.beehiiv.com/powered-by?publication_logo=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.beehiiv.com%2Fcdn-cgi%2Fimage%2Ffit%3Dscale-down%2Cformat%3Dauto%2Conerror%3Dredirect%2Cquality%3D80%2Fuploads%2Fpublication%2Flogo%2F9e0ab799-69a2-448f-b9a1-c03f8f3356e9%2FLogo_2.png%3Fv%3D1787455345&amp;amp;publication_name=Workspaces&amp;amp;utm_campaign=83a7dc4d-a69e-4e2c-9009-696c7bc81e7e&amp;amp;utm_medium=post_rss&amp;amp;utm_source=workspaces" target="_blank"&gt;由beehiiv提供支持&lt;/a&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 09 Feb 2023 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>